<title>MALAYSIA: GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-MALAYSIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading second round scores</p>
<p>in the Malaysian Open golf championship on Friday:</p>
<p>136 Lee Westwood (Britain) 64 72, Larry Barber (U.S.) 66</p>
<p>70</p>
<p>138 Christian Chernock (U.S.) 70 68, Harumitsu Hamano</p>
<p>(Japan) 71 67</p>
<p>139 Takao Nogami (Japan) 71 68, David Howell (Britain)</p>
<p>69 70, Brian Gay (U.S.) 72 67</p>
<p>140 Mike Cunning (U.S.) 69 71, Brett Partridge</p>
<p>(Australia) 72 68, Mohd Ali Kadir (Malaysia) 70 70.</p>
</text>
